# Build context is the repository root for both images, so this file is the one
# that applies (the per-package .dockerignore files are never read). Without it
# the host's node_modules — built for macOS — would be copied into the Linux
# build and shadow what `pnpm install` produces there.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/*.log
.git
.security
.tmp
infra
docs
tasks
